{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc38 Runner Frog</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runner Frog</strong> is a fast-paced 2D platformer with a speedrun twist.<br>Take control of a determined frog and dash through dangerous levels full of traps, platforms, and apples to collect. The goal is simple but addictive: <strong>finish each stage as fast as possible, with the fewest deaths, and the most apples gathered.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With precise controls and handcrafted challenges, Runner Frog offers the perfect mix of speed, difficulty, and replayability. Every death is just another chance to improve your run!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50 handcrafted levels</strong>, each with unique challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun-focused gameplay</strong>: master stages and aim for faster times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scoring system</strong> based on three factors: time, deaths, and apples collected.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tight and responsive controls</strong> designed for precision platforming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro pixel art style</strong>, colorful and nostalgic visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Increasing difficulty</strong> that tests your skill with every new stage.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 What You Get</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you purchase <strong>Runner Frog</strong>, you receive the full game with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All <strong>50 playable levels</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in <strong>speedrun challenges</strong> for every stage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>apple collection system</strong> to maximize your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replay value for those chasing the perfect run.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Stage 1 Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3983800/08b58112a02aec878c38f730de9a47386c1a2487.jpg"},{"name":"Stage 2 Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3983800/7e7890202a222cfbe92189ffbd8dede4d8efab23.jpg"},{"name":"Stage 3 Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3983800/8640703c90287629992e84570d0cca73e7d6b987.jpg"},{"name":"Stage 4 Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3983800/527d428e4fc4451226cdb6e76b056988afaa3681.jpg"},{"name":"Stage 6 Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3983800/30af55b6b1d02978a0e0f76ddf3043602aad7433.jpg"},{"name":"Stage 7 Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3983800/28b0ac5f07aebdf9c6760867e7b9087e6acd16c9.jpg"},{"name":"Stage 8 Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3983800/28e5325563000ff9752dfd537351b809340f029b.jpg"},{"name":"Stage 9 Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3983800/042fd5b0737fc02ba7ca799bdb7bbbd2baf31dab.jpg"},{"name":"Stage 10 Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3983800/addffb78281f42a47c05b20c3837f228c0a7402b.jpg"},{"name":"Stage 11 Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3983800/7718369fc14e2f2d56aabfb1d5b19027bd80c9d9.jpg"}],"total":50},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3983800?t=1759332417","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3983800?t=1759332417","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983800/08156b46146e114b5acaaaabf0e